                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0b2ca11-6f8c-3bcb-8753-e65f8aaf42c7",
                        "entry_id": "4d8413b6-75d9-39f6-8cab-84b837665dea",
                        "glosses": [
                            "self-preservation"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fffcd238-1595-471c-87cb-b150a61cafb9",
                                "sense_id": "c0b2ca11-6f8c-3bcb-8753-e65f8aaf42c7",
                                "text": "Челове́к, на кото́ром остана́вливался э́тот взор, не мог выноси́ть его́. Рожда́лось како́е-то совсе́м осо́бенное чу́вство, в кото́ром первенствующее значе́ние принадлежа́ло не сто́лько инсти́нкту ли́чного самосохране́ния, ско́лько опасе́нию за челове́ческую приро́ду вообще́.",
                                "translation": "The man on whom this gaze was fixed could not withstand it. He experienced a unique sensation, the main part of which was not so much the instinct of self-preservation as a feeling of apprehension for human nature in general.",
                                "english": "The man on whom this gaze was fixed could not withstand it. He experienced a unique sensation, the main part of which was not so much the instinct of self-preservation as a feeling of apprehension for human nature in general."
                            }
                        ]
